## Why This Is Asked
Tests CAPA fundamentals under real-world data issues: region awareness, basic data modeling, and a simple remediation flow.

## Key Concepts
- CAPA data model, lifecycle, REST API, regional metrics, RCA, canary.
- Trade-offs: latency of detection vs noise, data retention for evidence.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal Express REST endpoints
const express = require('express');
const app = express();
app.use(express.json());
let store = [];
app.post('/caps', (req, res)=>{ const cap={id:Date.now().toString(), ...req.body, status:'detected', created_at:new Date().toISOString()}; store.push(cap); res.status(201).json(cap);});
app.put('/caps/:id', (req,res)=>{ const idx=store.findIndex(c=>c.id===req.params.id); if(idx>=0){store[idx]={...store[idx], ...req.body}; res.json(store[idx]);} else res.status(404).end();});
app.listen(3000);
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you validate and test the canary plan before broader rollout?
- What telemetry would you capture to ensure no regression after remediation?

## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to design end-to-end CAPA for a secrets rotation bug with tenant isolation across regions, including data capture, lifecycle, APIs, metrics, and rollout controls.

## Key Concepts

- CAPA data model capturing tenant context, vault/version, exposure window, evidence, remediation.
- Region-aware lifecycle with states: detected, contained, eradicated, verified, closed.
- Minimal REST API: create/update CAPA, link logs/traces, idempotent operations.
- Metrics: recurrence rate, MTTR per region, false-positive rate, time-to-containment.
- RCA template and canary rollout validation plan before global deployment.

## Code Example

```javascript
type CAPA = {
  id: string;
  incidentId: string;
  tenantId: string;
  vaultVersion: string;
  exposureWindowMs: number;
  evidenceLinks: string[];
  remediation: string;
  state: "detected" | "contained" | "eradicated" | "verified" | "closed";
  region: string;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate the rotation gate cannot be bypassed in CI/CD pipelines?
- Which metrics best differentiate false positives from real exposures, and how would you alert on them?
- What logging/tracing strategy ties CAPAs to specific secrets and Vault rotations across regions?

